    /* Settings UI Note 0133: Mobile buttons are full width for easier tapping. */
    /* Settings UI Note 0134: Reduced-motion query supports users with motion sensitivity. */
    /* Settings UI Note 0135: Print rules remove decorative elements for cleaner output. */
    /* Settings UI Note 0136: Toast feedback appears when settings are submitted. */
    /* Settings UI Note 0137: Admin-only chip reinforces that this page controls operational settings. */
    /* Settings UI Note 0138: Helper text reminds admins to double-check payment details. */
