    /* Settings UI Note 0140: Footer call-to-action returns admins to the dashboard. */
    /* Settings UI Note 0141: Ocean and teal colors maintain the Dang's Beach Resort admin identity. */
    /* Settings UI Note 0142: Hero section frames settings as resort control center actions. */
    /* Settings UI Note 0143: Overview cards summarize payment name, payment number, and resort status. */
    /* Settings UI Note 0144: Payment configuration keeps the original gcash_name and gcash_number fields. */
